<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-FIVE NATIONS' CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-FIVE NATIONS' CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final standings in the Five</p>
<p>Nations' championship on Saturday (tabulate under - played, won,</p>
<p>drawn, lost, points for, against, points):</p>
<p> France     4    4     0    0   129    77   8</p>
<p> England    4    3     0    1   141    55   6</p>
<p> Wales	4    1     0    2    94   106   2</p>
<p> Scotland   4    1     0    3    90   132   2</p>
<p> Ireland    4    1     0    3    57   141   2</p>
<p>Results: Jan 18; Ireland 15 France 32, Scotland 19 Wales 34.</p>
<p>Feb 1; England 41 Scotland 13, Wales 25 Ireland 26. Feb 15;</p>
<p>Ireland 6 England 46, France 27 Wales 22. Mar 1; England 20</p>
<p>France 23, Scotland 38 Ireland 10; Mar 15; Wales 13 England 34,</p>
<p>France 47 Scotland 20.</p>
